/etc/ssl/certs links to /etc/pki/tls/certs, the OpenSSL hashed certificate
directory generated by update-ca-trust. Certificate bundle compatibility
links are not installed by default.

The generated TLS bundle is /etc/pki/ca-trust/extracted/pem/tls-ca-bundle.pem.
Put local trust inputs in /etc/pki/trust, not in the generated output.
